  "html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>编码与数据格式</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 数据类型一览</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">每个字段通过 f 标识数据类型：</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:815.109375\"><colgroup contenteditable=\"false\"><col width=\"183\"><col width=\"183\"><col width=\"183\"><col width=\"256.75\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 57.36px\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">f值</span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">类型</span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">JSON表示举例</span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">说明</span></p></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">1</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">bool</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"0\" / \"1\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">注意：用字符串，不是true/false</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">2</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">uint8</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"255\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">0-255</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">3</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">int8</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"-10\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">-128到127</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">4</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">string</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"BYD\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">普通文本</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">5</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">uint16</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"480\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">0-65535</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">6</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">float</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"25.5\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">去尾零，禁用科学计数法</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">7</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">object</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">{...}</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">JSON对象，保持原生类型</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">8</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">array</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">[...]</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">JSON数组，保持原生类型</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">9</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">double</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"114.123456\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">双精度浮点</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">10</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">uint32</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"100000\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">0-4294967295</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">11</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">int16</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"-100000\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">有符号16位整数</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">12</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">int32</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\"-100000\"</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">有符号32位整数</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">13</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">byte array</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">无</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">用于表示字节数组</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">常见错误提醒：</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">• ❌ \"v\": true — bool 类型要用字符串 \"0\" 或 \"1\"</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">• ❌ \"v\": 25 — 数值类型要用字符串 \"25\"</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">• ❌ \"v\": \"1.230e4\" — 禁止科学计数法</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. JSON 编码要点</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">数值统一使用字符串表示（如\"25\"而非 25），以与云家电物模型保持一致。接收端需持有 Profile 的 Schema（f 类型信息）进行反序列化。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">二进制字段（密钥、签名等）用 f:4（string）承载，内容采用 base64 编码（默认，膨胀 33%，适合 BLE 传输）；调试场景可选 hex 编码（膨胀 100%）。</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. CBOR 编码要点</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">CBOR 编码比 JSON 更紧凑，适用于 BLE 带宽受限场景或串口传输环境。CBOR 具有以下优势：</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">• 二进制字段直接用 byte string，无需 base64 编码（节省 33%体积）</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">• 整数键压缩（高频字段用整数代替字符串）</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>JSON vs CBOR</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 对比（以 3200B 的 Profile 为例）：</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:124\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=242></col><col width=142></col><col width=301></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">指标</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">JSON</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">CBOR</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">原始体积</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">3200B</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">~2400B（紧凑 25%）</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">base64 膨胀</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">+33%</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">0%（无膨胀）</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">分片数量（MTU=244）</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 27 片</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">12 片</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>"
}
